# Canvas course working tree (MCF3M)

- Archive source of truth: `courses/MCF3M/sources/mcf3m-canvas-export.imscc`
- Edit in `courses/MCF3M/canvas/unpacked/` (gitignored); do not commit media-heavy unpacks
- Commit/regenerate `courses/MCF3M/canvas/INVENTORY.md` + `inventory.json` after structural changes
- Agent brief: `agents/canvas-course-updater.md`; skill: `.cursor/skills/canvas-course-updater/SKILL.md`
- Key files: `imsmanifest.xml`, `course_settings/module_meta.xml`, `wiki_content/*.html`
- Never invent expectation codes; query `courses/MCF3M/curriculum/mcf3m.sqlite`
- Pack to a **new** `.imscc` via `python3 scripts/canvas_pack.py` — do not overwrite the source archive
